    "body": "Building for any iOS 26 simulator target (Xcode 16+, iOS 26.x runtime) fails because `libmdk_uniffi.a` does not include `arm64-apple-ios-simulator` slices built against the iOS 26 SDK.\n\n**Error:**\n```\nld: building for iOS Simulator-arm64 but attempting to link with file built for iOS-arm64\n```\n\n**Environment:**\n- Xcode 16.x (iOS 26.2 / 26.4 runtime)\n- Apple Silicon Mac\n- mdk-swift `main` branch (MDK 0.8.0)\n\n**Workaround:**\nBuild targets a physical device instead of the simulator. Device builds work correctly.\n\n**Request:**\nRe-compile `libmdk_uniffi.a` with iOS 26 simulator slices included and push an updated `main` (or tag a release).\n\nHappy to test a build if you need a guinea pig.",
